                                                    <div class="dics-capability-inner">
                                                        <p>
                                                            A structural list of raw materials, components, assemblies, and
                                                            sub-assemblies required to manufacture a finished product in Odoo MRP.
                                                            Includes routing and work center capacity logic.
                                                        </p>
                                                        <div class="dics-tags">
                                                            <span>MRP</span>
                                                            <span>Inventory</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                            <article class="card dics-glossary-card h-100 shadow" data-category="manufacturing logistics">
