                                                <small class="text-muted fw-semibold">ARCHITECTURAL NOTE // ODOO 18 EXTENSION</small>
                                                <h3 class="h5 mt-2">
                                                    Classic Polymorphism: <code>_inherit</code> vs. <code>_inherits</code>
                                                </h3>
                                                <p class="mb-0">
                                                    Use <code>_inherit</code> for in-place extension or classical Python subtyping.
                                                    Reserve <code>_inherits</code> for delegation inheritance when you need
                                                    polymorphic composition without duplicating underlying tables.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

